# Vendored frontend builds

Production serves **committed** static output, not Vite at deploy time:

- CRM UI: edit `apps/mytrion-crm/src/` → run `pnpm build:widget` → commit `apps/mytrion-crm/app/`
- Mini-app: edit `apps/mini-app/src/` → run `pnpm -C apps/mini-app build` → commit `apps/mini-app/app/`

Do this **before opening or pushing a PR** that changes those UIs. Source-only PRs leave prod on the old screen. Full rule: `CLAUDE.md` / `AGENTS.md` → **Vendored frontend builds**.
